{"unit_id":"xohmai__dsh-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"xohmai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f86f4dadfd4be1239b423bb893e21da4ff4d2239","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 是面向 DSH Web 的会话管理插件，在设置页提供归档会话、全部会话和回收站三个视图。它通过 Host HTTP 路由读取会话与工作区信息，并把删除的日志目录移入 DSH home 下的回收站。用户可以搜索筛选、批量删除、还原归档或回收站中的会话，也能永久清理回收站；删除当前会话时界面会切换到新会话。正在运行的会话会被拒绝删除。适合需要清理本地会话日志并保留短期恢复机会的 DSH Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:328-342","src/index.js:889-905","src/index.js:595-630","src/index.js:739-780"]}
{"unit_id":"xohmai__dsh-session-delete#card-en","repo":"xohmai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f86f4dadfd4be1239b423bb893e21da4ff4d2239","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-delete adds a session manager to DSH Web. Browse and filter sessions, move logs to trash, restore them, or clear trash permanently. Running sessions are refused; deleting the current session opens a new one. Reclaim session storage with a recovery option.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.js:328-342","src/index.js:889-905","src/index.js:595-630","src/index.js:739-780"]}
