{"unit_id":"xohmai__dsh-session-delete#feature-unarchive","repo":"xohmai/dsh-session-delete","commit":"f86f4dadfd4be1239b423bb893e21da4ff4d2239","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-delete 的功能「解除归档」：对仍在磁盘清单中的归档会话执行在线解除归档；界面依据 Host 能力显示可用的还原操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:247-290"]}
